(b) Sangai (Dancing Deer) -> (ii) Keibul Lamjao National Park (Manipur)
(c) Lion-tailed Macaque   -> (iii) Silent Valley National Park (Kerala)
(d) Red Panda             -> (iv) Singalila National Park (West Bengal / Sikkim)', 'Great Indian Bustard = Desert NP; Sangai = Keibul Lamjao; Lion-tailed Macaque = Silent Valley; Red Panda = Singalila.', NOW()) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
