(c) Mangalyaan     -> (iii) Mars orbit insertion
(d) Astrosat       -> (iv) Multi-wavelength space astronomical observatory', 'Chandrayaan-3 = Lunar South Pole; Aditya-L1 = Sun L1; Mangalyaan = Mars; Astrosat = Multi-wavelength space telescope.', NOW()) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
