(c) Thang-Ta      -> (iii) Punjab (Sikh martial tradition)
(d) Gatka         -> (iv) Tamil Nadu (Bamboo staff martial art)', 'Kalaripayattu = Kerala; Silambam = Tamil Nadu; Thang-Ta = Manipur; Gatka = Punjab.', NOW()) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
