(a) Strait of Gibraltar -> (i) Red Sea with Mediterranean Sea
(b) Suez Canal          -> (ii) Atlantic Ocean with Pacific Ocean (locks)
(c) Panama Canal        -> (iii) Atlantic Ocean with Mediterranean Sea
(d) Strait of Malacca   -> (iv) Indian Ocean with South China Sea (Pacific)', 'Gibraltar = Atlantic/Med; Suez = Red/Med; Panama = Atlantic/Pacific; Malacca = Indian/Pacific.', NOW()) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
